{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/de4ebf8d6ba78de81b2d7738a2b0f998.avif?t=1773168410\" width=780 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into a strange realm to rescue your friend and confront evil incarnate \u2014 a sandbox RPG where growth means more than just numbers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Descension</i>, you take on the role of <strong>Ruby</strong>, a young man burdened by guilt after losing a childhood friend to the mysterious well at the heart of his hometown. Years later, Ruby and his friends return as adults to descend into that same well \u2014 now revealed to be a gateway to the <strong>Alternate Realm</strong>, a place where fairies, monsters, and an ancient force known as <strong>The Ultimate Entity</strong> dwell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: overcome ten powerful bosses, each embodying a different <strong>Element of Essence</strong>, and unlock the truth at the heart of the world. Every victory strengthens not only your stats, but your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/3ee2937775715766e556807e8b994d05.poster.avif?t=1773168410\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/3ee2937775715766e556807e8b994d05.webm?t=1773168410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sandbox RPG for Stat Fanatics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is locked behind story progression \u2014 everything is available from the start.<br> Forge your own path, customize every character, and experiment with countless builds. Whether you want to master every skill, perfect your stats, or simply explore freely, <i>Descension</i> rewards creativity and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/31fda196485a1dc7f19bab1c359b982a.avif?t=1773168410\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat, Reimagined</strong> \u2013 Classic strategy with modern flexibility. Swap party members mid-battle and chain abilities for tactical depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/4b0968d07e3e170efba0cfe0cb17909a.poster.avif?t=1773168410\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/4b0968d07e3e170efba0cfe0cb17909a.webm?t=1773168410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Progression</strong> \u2013 Explore and tackle challenges in any order \u2014 no level gating or linear paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17+ Unique Soul Shards (Classes)</strong> \u2013 Forget White Mages and Warriors. Every Soul Shard introduces new mechanics and playstyles unseen in other RPGs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/d783907d15029d2c226f450ab5d2d476.poster.avif?t=1773168410\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/d783907d15029d2c226f450ab5d2d476.webm?t=1773168410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 Core Stats</strong> \u2013 Each stat affects both combat and character. Strength reflects physical and emotional fortitude; Psyche ties into mental health and willpower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ Elemental Bosses</strong> \u2013 Face the embodiments of essence in escalating, boss-rush-style encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Fully Customizable Party Members</strong> \u2013 Build your dream team with total freedom over jobs, stats, and skill sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Gem System</strong> \u2013 Store energy and unleash devastating attacks at the perfect moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Side Stories</strong> \u2013 Help the fairies of the Alternate Realm through moral choices and earn new tools, minigames, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist but Meaningful Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Experience an emotional journey of guilt, growth, and redemption told through your actions and the world itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/26df76f18ee00562a8b698ee44b35de8.poster.avif?t=1773168410\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/26df76f18ee00562a8b698ee44b35de8.webm?t=1773168410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey of Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stat tells a story. Every battle is a reflection of inner strength.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437580?t=1773168410","bac