, each embodying a different <strong>Element of Essence</strong>, and unlock the truth at the heart of the world. Every victory strengthens not only your stats, but your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/3ee2937775715766e556807e8b994d05.poster.avif?t=1773168410\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/3ee2937775715766e556807e8b994d05.webm?t=1773168410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sandbox RPG for Stat Fanatics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is locked behind story progression \u2014 everything is available from the start.<br> Forge your own path, customize every character, and experiment with countless builds. Whether you want to master every skill, perfect your stats, or simply explore freely, <i>Descension</i> rewards creativity and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/31fda196485a1dc7f19bab1c359b982a.avif?t=1773168410\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat, Reimagined</strong> \u2013 Classic strategy with modern flexibility. Swap party members mid-battle and chain abilities for tactical depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437580/extras/4b0968d07e3e170efba0cfe0cb17909a.poster.avif?t=1773168410\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akama